(text "OPTIONAL for v1 (~14 g). TX/RX cross over." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 345.44 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 115 55 175 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4bbe008d-886f-41cb-8c86-0e5530ae8dc2"))
(text "Header order varies by batch: trust the silkscreen." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 345.44 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 115 55 175 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "64f55aba-2e59-4df6-9280-c9fba7c49122"))
(text "GND to Pico pin 3. Antenna side up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 345.44 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 115 55 175 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9839172f-c535-4d7b-9651-f14863784e84"))
(rectangle (start 185.42 129.54) (end 281.94 281.94) (stroke (width 0.3) (type dash) (color 170 100 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 170 100 0 0.05)) (uuid "b10f47e7-ca5e-4b74-932a-bdf493624f9c"))
(text "BUILD NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032) (bold yes) (color 170 100 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a1b5afb3-2105-4c6d-8f4b-fcfac4aa44f7"))
(text "1. Battery (+) goes DIRECT to DRV1 VM and DRV2 VM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f5cdb4b3-de78-4fee-b8fc-ac0f0f737bf8"))
(text "    The Pico is powered only through D1 into VSYS (pin 39)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 145.415 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "57194d31-9d26-4049-a2d9-aa2336cdb8a4"))
(text "2. C1, C2: 470 µF ≥10 V electrolytic, soldered right at each" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "71dbc647-5888-4814-bd35-41b45bbd6678"))
(text "    driver's VM/GND pins, stripe (-) to GND. REQUIRED - not fitted" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 153.035 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "734ac605-e518-41fc-9de0-cbaa111c5f54"))
(text "    on the current build." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8670759e-ed17-44ac-a639-467186fee2d4"))
(text "3. Until C1/C2 are fitted: connect the battery BEFORE USB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 160.655 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "26eeb565-33c9-496e-a96c-a3611276d576"))
(text "4. Star ground: one wire each from battery (-) to DRV1 GND," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8139d2b9-68f1-49f6-9f7d-a45ca70a7f84"))
(text "    DRV2 GND and Pico pin 38. Never daisy-chain them." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 168.275 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5e8f3a78-7722-46b4-bcf3-67e1e03a54f4"))
(text "5. Pin 40 (VBUS) is USB 5 V: leave it unconnected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8d1373e4-bff1-4852-8228-bdbd39f5a7e0"))
(text "    Pin 36 (3V3 OUT) feeds the sensors only, never motors." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 175.895 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9137e9d0-b6d9-4f75-9a0c-a2a2a0193add"))
(text "6. MOTOR_ARM (GP15) and DRV_nFAULT (GP14) go to BOTH drivers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ac8560a6-31ba-4ce9-84dd-f52046a985a8"))
(text "    nFAULT uses the Pico's internal pull-up; skip it if your" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 183.515 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "29aae39e-58fd-4ccc-bf76-f9b7e271954d"))
(text "    board has no nFAULT / ULT pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 186.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f8260cae-1d8c-42e6-82fa-2318b2dd64c2"))
(text "7. Spin: M1, M2 CCW and M3, M4 CW, seen from above." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 191.135 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "17086e3e-0ee7-4463-a338-42fec816cafd"))
(text "    Swap a motor's two leads to reverse it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a4bccd08-0d18-4d0e-9eaf-ea90c8a52f49"))
(text "8. Firmware: this sheet is STANDARD wiring, so set" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 198.755 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6c6bc478-4e0b-4e92-b7cf-d0a5b92a523d"))
(text "    lift.py WIRING = \"STANDARD\" (it defaults to \"SHARED\")." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 201.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9f3f874a-c7c7-4378-a98b-aeb9b9b0e959"))
(text "9. GPS is optional for v1. UART crosses over:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 206.375 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b551e5df-6b39-46eb-a1cc-18362cc776ce"))
(text "    GPS TX -> GP1 (pin 2), GPS RX <- GP0 (pin 1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 209.55 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "56a4ae5f-638c-403c-8137-948243069c18"))
(text "10. Props OFF for every bench test except lift.py." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 213.995 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a9d7445-933f-4aaf-91d3-350e2c62ac8a"))
(text "HOW TO READ THIS SHEET" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes) (color 170 100 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3b1a47e2-b4be-49cd-b611-4bc22f9c5d90"))
(text "Tags with the same name (e.g. M1_PWM) are wired together." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 227.965 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2a7c21b5-5be3-4120-9b13-b8fe0697c429"))
(text "X on a pin = leave that pin unconnected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "763c35cc-d473-4580-be24-8271c0c07c4b"))
(text "GND, +3V3, +BATT and VSYS symbols = connect to that rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 234.315 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d22446e6-22db-4e37-b23e-536fcebb13e7"))
